 detail:{image:"public/images/artworks/Monreale-Pantocrator-Face.jpg",alt:"A close view of the face. Long, calm eyes look straight out. The cheeks, nose and brow are drawn with curving lines of light and dark color, and the hair and beard are made of wavy bands. Behind the head, the gold disk shows tiny speckled tiles and a cross with a jeweled pattern.",caption:"Technique detail: up close, the face and hair are drawn with curving lines made of tiny tiles",credit:{word:"Detail photo (face)",url:"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Christ_Pantocrator_-_Cathedral_of_Monreale_-_Italy_2015_(2).JPG",author:"Jos\u00e9 Luiz Bernardes Ribeiro",license:"CC BY-SA 4.0",licenseUrl:"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",changes:"Resized from the original."}},
